    "created_at": "2015-11-23T02:04:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T02:08:32Z",
    "body": "Will be one common convention comparing to Element, where we don't have slot for qualified name, so for example Element.tagName performs \"similar operations\". Other specifications don't use Attr's name from DOM as references?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
