    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T09:51:24Z",
    "body": "Well, what the specification says currently is more like `name = prefix === null ? localName : prefix + \":\" + localName` or some such. I'm happy to drop this slot though. I might keep the concept, but turn it into a getter-like algorithm.\n",
