    "created_at": "2015-11-23T09:58:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T09:58:31Z",
    "body": "Yes, that is exactly how `QualifiedName::toString()` is implemented in Blink, and having that as an algorithm instead of a slot might be nice.\n\nIt looks like the concept is only used in attribute lookup, so another model could be to try eliminating it entirely, instead having _qualified name_ variables in the few places where it's needed. That's entirely editorial, though.\n",
